 "### mcp:orders/get_orders\n\nFetch all order records in one bulk response.\n\n**Call**: `await orders_get_orders()`\n\n**Parameters**\n*(no parameters)*\n\n**Returns**\n- `result` (object[], required)\n\nRules for execute_code snippets: every binding is async \u2014 always `await`; call capability functions with keywords exactly as shown (positional calls fail on the default backend); awaiting a capability returns the tool's plain value, already unwrapped \u2014 never index into a ['result'] or ['value'] envelope; `return` a JSON-shaped value.\nThe namespace also binds surfaces search does not list: `save_result`/`load_result`.\nDetails only when needed: toolplane://namespace (full manifest) and skill://driving-toolplane/SKILL.md (conventions)."}}}
